{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfa5eT5dutrPBumzooh8w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The work was already done when I started. An earlier session had committed it as `606f47e`, which adds `just spec-check` to the pre-commit hook and rewrites SPEC.v1 to pass it. In this session I checked that the gate works and made one commit through the full hook.\n\n**The gate:**\n- The hook is installed (`core.hooksPath` points to `.githooks`), and `.githooks/pre-commit` runs `just check` and then `just spec-check`.\n- `just spec-check` passes on the current spec.\n- To show a violation blocks it, I broke a checkbox on purpose (`- [?]`). The check failed and pointed at `docs/specs/SPEC.v1-todo-list-cli-mvp.md:47`. After restoring the file it passed again.\n- Your prompt was still uncommitted in `docs/PROMPTS.md`, so I committed it as `7245613 docs(prompts): log quality-gates-3 re-run prompt`. The hook ran both gates first: formatting OK, 20 of 20 tests passed, 0 warnings, spec-check passed.\n\n**How it matches the expected observations:** the \"commit fails at first, then fix the spec\" part happened in the earlier session's run. This session only reproduced the failure with the deliberate break above.\n\n**Environment problems:** the commit failed a few times before it went through. None of this came from the repo or the spec, and I changed no files to work around it. What I had to set, only for that commit:\n- **`just`:** it couldn't write its temp files to `/run/user/1000`, so I pointed `XDG_RUNTIME_DIR` at `/tmp/xdg-rt`.\n- **sbt:** `SBT_NATIVE_CLIENT=true` in your shell makes sbt read `scalafmtCheckAll test` as one command, so I set it to `false`.\n- **sbt cache:** sbt can't write to `~/.sbt`, so I pointed it at the workshop's own `.cache`.\n\nOn a normal setup a plain `git commit` should work. `.claude/agents/` is still untracked; I left it alone because it looks like it belongs to the workshop harness, not the project."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":819,"cache_read_input_tokens":33723,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":819},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"739cab7b-8af2-4332-87f4-acb8c446f5f9","uuid":"a1054135-5efa-4db0-95ba-1bb9352d582d","timestamp":"2026-09-30T18:16:05.936Z","request_id":"req_011Cfa5eShKc8z7xkLDNuJUb"}
